pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177);\">★ 방문설명회 일시 : 2019.6.3.(월) 14시</span></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177);\">★ 방문설명회 장소 : 든사람교육센터(도서관 211호)</span></strong></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">☆ 설명시간은 약 20분 정도 소요 예정이며, 설명 후 질의 응답시간 있음</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">☆ 한국장학재단 소득구간(분위)와는 상관없이 신청 <span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">가능</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(61, 0, 153);\"><strong>☆ </strong></span><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&amp;articleNo=225246&amp;article.offset=0&amp;articleLimit=10\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(61, 0, 153);\"><strong><strong>학생모집 안내문 바로 가기</strong></strong></span></a></span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><div style=\"background: url(&quot;/_common/_plugin/daumeditor/images/deco/contents/horizontalrule/line08.gif?v=2&quot;) repeat-x left; width: 99%; height: 15px;\"><hr style=\"border: 0px black; border-image: none; left: -9999px; top: -9999px; position: relative;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><br></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177);\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153);\">★</span></strong></span></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153);\">히어로 양성사업 운영 계획(안)을 아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</span></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">1. 추진 내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ㅇ</span> 장학생 모집</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (모집 대상) 사업 참여 대학 중 스타기업에서 현장근로 후 취업을&nbsp; 희망하는 4년제 대학 졸업예정자</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (방문설명회) 참여 대학 대상 방문 사업설명회 개최를 통한 사업안내&nbsp; * 히어로 양성사업 및 국가 근로장학사업 안내</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ㅇ‘매칭데이’실시를 통한 참여기업 면접 및 학생선발</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (서류심사) 공개모집을 통한 지원 접수 후 지망 기업별 서류자격 심사&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - (매칭데이) 학생이 희망하는 중소기업(스타기업) 인사담당자가 참여하여 학생 면접을 진행하고, 상호 탐색 및 학생 선발 결정</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; ㅇ 매칭기업 현장근로</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 매칭인원 대상 대구TP 주관 직무양성과정 운영</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ․ 기업소양교육(기업예절, 기업경영원리 등) 40시간 ＋ 온라인 직무교육과정 운영</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - &nbsp;(기간) 기업소양교육 종료 후 약 6개월 * 조기 채용 등에 따라 기간 단축 가능</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 학기 중에는 수업시간을 제외한 탄력근무제 적용</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 근로시간, 중복수혜 기준은 국가근로장학사업 업무처리기준을 준용</span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 1.2; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-